title: "Burst-Robust Codes for Life and Qubits: Correlated-Event Reliability, Holographic Erasure Recovery, and Finite Repair Capacity"
authors:
  - family-names: Debnath
    given-names: Devanik
    affiliation: National Institute of Technology Agartala, India
version: "2.0"
date-released: 2026-11-06
type: article
abstract: >-
  A cross-domain statistical framework for marked spatial disturbance events,
  code-specific recovery, and finite repair workload, accompanied by a
  reproducible finite-lattice synthetic benchmark. Quantum and biological
  mechanisms are kept distinct; no universal threshold is claimed.
keywords:
